{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1045","endTime":304987.672,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 03\nLittle Butterflies.\n\nA family-focused website introducing Little Butterflies through childcare imagery, service information, and a welcoming visual identity.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nChildcare & family\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA warm welcome for little beginnings.\n\nLittle Butterflies’ web presentation centers on a family invitation and information about its organization. The supplied layouts use photographs of children, introductory content, and service cards to guide visitors from a first impression toward learning more about the offering.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Little Butterflies's original project material.\n\n01\nFamily introduction\n\nA prominent welcome section establishes the audience and organization.\n\n02\nAbout information\n\nDedicated content introduces the people and purpose behind the brand.\n\n03\nService cards\n\nIndividual cards break the offering into scannable sections.\n\n04\nDevice presentations\n\nOriginal desktop and tablet mockups show the site’s visual treatment.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nChildcare & family\n\nPeach backgrounds, soft illustrated edges, and rounded content blocks create a gentle visual rhythm. The logo’s bright colors remain small accents, allowing family photography and accessible text sections to lead the page.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Little Butterflies.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nLittle Butterflies's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nLittle Butterflies / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nTukeeConnect\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nORGANIZATION & COLLABORATION\nTukeeConnect\nFASHION & COMMERCE\nBeliri\nPHOTOGRAPHY & COMMERCE\nPrintlific\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
